 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bqbscDEb_0gQ7kNvwEqhnuJ&_nc_oc=AdqkbRiEpjiGJKPrIE3hxQY9LcIkmNZskpPV6j9LWwt19NrK6gEKWaHskCyv1-OS8Lk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLItoU5qBaXGf57soSW54Gl44_UYHqVZPrQCfH74QP7zg&oe=6AB7E241"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rXaLL-zFp8wQ7kNvwE8m5Og&_nc_oc=AdpKyAhNFrva55vH_EzwMbVpDU-CMNfS-a8zIC4UkjoiniTod7jgk-6ElYPol48z87A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIL40IhFg5XQ-yJ42qid7VV-AKLEWnF5WiO7v1GAd3z7Q&oe=6AB7B766"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T7xTGszljKsQ7kNvwGgZUcZ&_nc_oc=AdrznX92qSo_PP0zNkAuOs06a7oQP2CeaLQyt9oAJkDLgc0welycN_CrLDbvUAat4wE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKQimzRqjDLdakPBMidVuhijdGnAQGZNGCYqhdZBUWV9g&oe=6AB7C15C"}, {"fil